<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>High Spirit - Maintenance</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 50%, #0f172a 100%);
            color: #e2e8f0;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* Animated background particles */
        .bg-particles {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            z-index: 0;
        }
        .bg-particles::before,
        .bg-particles::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            border-radius: 50%;
            opacity: 0.08;
            animation: float 8s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        .bg-particles::before {
            width: 400px; height: 400px;
            background: #3b82f6;
            top: -100px; right: -100px;
            animation-delay: 0s;
        }
        .bg-particles::after {
            width: 300px; height: 300px;
            background: #60a5fa;
            bottom: -80px; left: -80px;
            animation-delay: 4s;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-30px) scale(1.05); }
        }

        .container {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            max-width: 560px;
            width: 90%;
        }

        /* Gear animation */
        .icon-wrapper {
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .gear {
            width: 80px; height: 80px;
            fill: #3b82f6;
            animation: spin 4s linear infinite;
        }
        .gear-small {
            width: 50px; height: 50px;
            fill: #60a5fa;
            position: absolute;
            right: -20px; bottom: -5px;
            animation: spin-reverse 3s linear infinite;
        }
        @keyframes spin { from { transform: rotate(0deg); } to { transform: rotate(360deg); } }
        @keyframes spin-reverse { from { transform: rotate(360deg); } to { transform: rotate(0deg); } }

        .brand {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .brand span {
            color: #3b82f6;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #f1f5f9;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .message {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        /* Progress bar */
        .progress-bar {
            width: 100%;
            height: 4px;
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }
        .progress-bar-inner {
            height: 100%;
            width: 30%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #3b82f6, #60a5fa);
            border-radius: 4px;
            animation: loading 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes loading {
            0% { width: 10%; margin-left: 0; }
            50% { width: 40%; margin-left: 30%; }
            100% { width: 10%; margin-left: 90%; }
        }

        .status-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 0.5rem 1.2rem;
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #60a5fa;
        }
        .status-dot {
            width: 8px; height: 8px;
            background: #3b82f6;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: pulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
            50% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(0.8); }
        }

        .footer-text {
            margin-top: 2.5rem;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #475569;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="bg-particles"></div>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Animated Gears -->
        <div class="icon-wrapper">
            <svg class="gear" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M12 15.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 8.5 12 3.5 3.5 0 0 1 12 8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 3.5 3.5 3.5 3.5 0 0 1-3.5 3.5m7.43-2.53c.04-.32.07-.64.07-.97s-.03-.66-.07-1l2.11-1.63c.19-.15.24-.42.12-.64l-2-3.46c-.12-.22-.39-.3-.61-.22l-2.49 1c-.52-.4-1.08-.73-1.69-.98l-.38-2.65C14.46 2.18 14.25 2 14 2h-4c-.25 0-.46.18-.49.42l-.38 2.65c-.61.25-1.17.59-1.69.98l-2.49-1c-.23-.09-.49 0-.61.22l-2 3.46c-.13.22-.07.49.12.64L4.57 11c-.04.34-.07.67-.07 1s.03.65.07.97l-2.11 1.66c-.19.15-.25.42-.12.64l2 3.46c.12.22.39.3.61.22l2.49-1.01c.52.4 1.08.73 1.69.98l.38 2.65c.03.24.24.42.49.42h4c.25 0 .46-.18.49-.42l.38-2.65c.61-.25 1.17-.58 1.69-.98l2.49 1.01c.22.08.49 0 .61-.22l2-3.46c.12-.22.07-.49-.12-.64L19.43 12.97Z"/>
            </svg>
            <svg class="gear-small" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M12 15.5A3.5 3.5 0 0 1 8.5 12 3.5 3.5 0 0 1 12 8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 3.5 3.5 3.5 3.5 0 0 1-3.5 3.5m7.43-2.53c.04-.32.07-.64.07-.97s-.03-.66-.07-1l2.11-1.63c.19-.15.24-.42.12-.64l-2-3.46c-.12-.22-.39-.3-.61-.22l-2.49 1c-.52-.4-1.08-.73-1.69-.98l-.38-2.65C14.46 2.18 14.25 2 14 2h-4c-.25 0-.46.18-.49.42l-.38 2.65c-.61.25-1.17.59-1.69.98l-2.49-1c-.23-.09-.49 0-.61.22l-2 3.46c-.13.22-.07.49.12.64L4.57 11c-.04.34-.07.67-.07 1s.03.65.07.97l-2.11 1.66c-.19.15-.25.42-.12.64l2 3.46c.12.22.39.3.61.22l2.49-1.01c.52.4 1.08.73 1.69.98l.38 2.65c.03.24.24.42.49.42h4c.25 0 .46-.18.49-.42l.38-2.65c.61-.25 1.17-.58 1.69-.98l2.49 1.01c.22.08.49 0 .61-.22l2-3.46c.12-.22.07-.49-.12-.64L19.43 12.97Z"/>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="brand">High <span>Spirit</span></div>
        <h1>We'll Be Right Back!</h1>

        <p class="message">
            Our system is currently undergoing a scheduled update to bring you
            new features and improvements. This won't take long — we appreciate
            your patience!
        </p>

        <div class="progress-bar">
            <div class="progress-bar-inner"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="status-badge">
            <div class="status-dot"></div>
            Maintenance in progress
        </div>

        <p class="footer-text">
            &copy; High Spirit Gym &amp; Fitness &mdash; Thank you for your patience
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
